	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Pick a Kiosk Satellite tablet (from Home Assistant) and open its admin page in Firefox.

- Enter: open admin URL
- Cmd+Enter: open the device page in Home Assistant
- Alt+Enter: copy the admin URL

kadm:token &lt;token or op:// ref&gt; saves the HA token to the Keychain; kadm:url &lt;url&gt; saves the HA URL.

See README.md in the source repo for setup.</string>
